The '''Atoned Revenant''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} for the [[Zombie Slayer]].

== Spawning ==
The '''Atoned Revenant''' has a small chance to be spawned when a player with an active {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}} {{SlayerTier|V}} Quest kills any [[Zombie]] outside of [[Dungeons]]. When this happens, an explosion effect takes place, and the Atoned Revenant will spawn.

== Behavior ==
The '''Atoned Revenant''' runs towards the player to attack them.

